WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.080
Gleb: It is about time!

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:10.580
Gleb: Iden Versio. The Admiral sent you. I knew I was important, but to risk his own daughter's life?

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.080
Iden: Target acquired. Get a move on Gleb.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.940
Gleb: She is giving me orders now. Precious.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.380
Hask: Whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa! Get back!

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.860
Gleb: No, he is with me. The others will stay here. They are not important. Come!

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.000
Del: Commander.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.840
Del: We have a ship on Landing Bay 2. You'll be safe there. Go. Go now. Go!

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.560
Hask: Whoa whoa, what are you- no, stop!

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.000
Iden: Hask!

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.670
Hask: Stop! This is not our mission.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:41.960
Iden: Stand down.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.920
Iden: It's okay. We'll get you off world. Go.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.320
Hask: No. No. No. Don't you...

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.870
Iden: I am your Commander, stand down!

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:59.200
Hask: Iden, our orders are clear. We are to recover the Protectorate Gleb alone.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:05.540
Del: Things have changed. Look around you, man. Do you even recognize the Empire anymore?

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.330
Hask: Del, please don't do this. Just don't do this.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:11.000
Iden: The Empire's job is to save civilians from things like Operation: Cinder.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.180
Hask: This is the new Empire.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:23.240
Del: If this is the new Empire I want no part of it. I'm taking the orders of my commanding officer.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:28.680
Hask: Are these your orders? Are these your orders? Because if they are this is treason.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:33.420
Hask: Are these your orders?

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:38.540
Iden: Yes.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:43.800
Hask: Then I have mine.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:45.640
Iden: Lower your weapon.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.580
Hask: Defiance will be the death of you.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:50.120
Hask: Agh!

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.000
Hask: Admiral Versio

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:08.500
Hask: Commander Versio and Agent Meeko have abandoned the mission. They have committed treason. I'm sorry.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:15.060
Garrick: Understood. Return Gleb to me, that is your mission. I will take care of the traitors.
